<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MACIRCLE_W" width = "5.006mm" height = "3.006mm"/>
: Replaced
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When ECM is replaced with new one, refer to “Procedure after ECM Replacement”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
K14C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1316002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
K14D model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
When ECM and ISG are replaced with new ones at the same time, perform either “ECM Registration” or “Integrated Starter Generator (48V model) Registration”. This performance will complete both ECM and ISG registrations.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When ECM and/or ISG (K14D model) and BCM are replaced with new ones at the same time, perform “Immobilizer Key Registration” using SUZUKI scan tool and security device. Refer to Operator’s Manual of SUZUKI scan tool for the immobilizer registration.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
